PASS  /work/docs is unchanged
FAIL  /work/preview.txt does not exist yet (or is empty)
FAIL  the mirror still has the deleted files old-plan.md and drafts/scratch.md — the real run needs --delete too

RESULT: FAIL (2 check(s) failed)
[exit 1]

# solution.md
$ cd /work && rsync -ain --delete --exclude='*.swp' --exclude=.cache/ docs/ mirror/ > /work/preview.txt

